# "Counter up to one target spell": cast with no spell targeted, Repulsive Mutation just puts its X counters on the Mystic.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Elvish Mystic
Repulsive Mutation
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Repulsive Mutation.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Repulsive Mutation
